      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**Coverage differs.** Servers = hosts scraped by the IPMI exporter (the OpenStack fleet only). Switches = every Cumulus switch in NetBox for the site, including racks with no monitored servers. A rack total is therefore *our hosts + all switches*, not the rack's full draw."
      }
